The Castle has just a trench of water, 1 square wide, so if you have
a wand of striking to smash down the drawbridge you could have bridged
that square with your wand of cold. With the help of a music instrument
(soldiers have bugles) you could also try to open the drawbridge.[*]

If you found a large watery area you're likely at Medusa's level. You
may use boulders to bridge the water[**], with the use of one or both
of the scrolls of earth from the lowest Sokoban level.

> Is there any place further on past the castle that
> would give her a reasonable chance to gain flying, waterwalking,
> waterbreathing, or levitatioin?

Yes, there are water walking boots in Vlad's Tower down in Gehennom.
If you happen to get jumping boots you may also jump across the water
(i.e. from one solid spot to the next).

